# @hub-lanes

# ── GH SHIM CACHE SWEEP (BH-9453) ───────────────────────────────────────────
# bin/gh-cache-sweep.sh: every GH_CACHE_SWEEP_PERIOD_S (default 900 s) it reads
# each registry repo's open PRs and updated issues, drops the shim cache
# entries of what changed with no webhook wake, and writes a per-repo stamp
# that ghc_sweep_covers reads. Log: logs/gh-cache-sweep.log, one line a run.
# Off via GH_CACHE_SWEEP=0 or flags/lane-off-gh-cache-sweep.
*/5 * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/gh-cache-sweep.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
